    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Jump, swing, and swat your way through the alien invasion!</h2> Space Block Buster is a \u2018Breakout\u2019 inspired game that takes  inspiration from the arcade games of the past and creates a new excitement-filled VR experience. Compete for the high score on each level by unlocking new buffs and items to defeat the alien invasion. But watch out! Some of these aliens fight back!<br><br><br>With a racket in each hand, swing and hit balls to defeat the aliens that are invading each planet. Destroy everything blocking your path to make it to the stage\u2019s final boss, guarding its territory by using space powers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Get your friends &amp; family hooked on VR!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Intuitive gameplay that allows even the newest VR users to enjoy themselves from the very start.<br></li><li> Simple, yet addicting and challenging once you get to higher stages.<br></li><li> Excellent for small spaces thanks to the racket extension function.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Single-player mode: 40 stages &amp; 4 boss stages with their own unique themes and skills<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198290/extras/99de4b58522ac4c0e29a2bdff9cff95c.poster.avif?t=1665128923\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198290/extras/99de4b58522ac4c0e29a2bdff9cff95c.webm?t=1665128923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198290/extras/99de4b58522ac4c0e29a2bdff9cff95c.mp4?t=1665128923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br></li><li> Multiverse mode: PVP mode that allows you to compete against other players<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sh